#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:1
msgid "Reports, runtime and extensions"
msgstr "报告、运行时与扩展"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:3
msgid ""
"Two connected layers live here: a typed report model that every backend "
"renders, and a runtime layer that turns operations into catalog entries and "
"execution results. Both favour explicit contracts over convenience."
msgstr "这里有两层相互衔接的东西：所有后端都会渲染的类型化报表模型，以及把操作变成目录条目与执行结果的运行时层。两者都偏好显式契约而不是便利。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:7
msgid "One document, many backends"
msgstr "一份文档，多种后端"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:9
msgid "`report_document` is the single value a report is built from:"
msgstr "`report_document` 是构建报表的唯一值："

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:11
msgid ""
"fincore::report_document document;\n"
"document.domain = \"portfolio\";\n"
"document.title = \"Monthly review\";\n"
"document.metadata = {{\"source\", \"fixture\"}};\n"
msgstr ""
"fincore::report_document document;\n"
"document.domain = \"portfolio\";\n"
"document.title = \"Monthly review\";\n"
"document.metadata = {{\"source\", \"fixture\"}};\n"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:18
msgid ""
"A document holds sections; a section holds `metrics`, `tables`, `series`, "
"`notes`, `units` and `legends`. Values are typed cells — text, number, "
"boolean or missing — so a backend never has to guess whether a column is "
"numeric."
msgstr ""
"文档包含多个 section；每个 section 包含 `metrics`、`tables`、`series`、`notes`、`units` 与 "
"`legends`。值是带类型的单元格 —— 文本、数值、布尔或缺失 —— 因此后端无需猜测某列是否为数值。"

