msgstr "调用方提供的坐标轴标记为非拥有"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:31
msgid ""
"Rendering the same document twice produces byte-identical output for the "
"deterministic backends. That is what makes reports safe to hash and diff, "
"and it is why the workbook writer fixes the ZIP timestamps instead of "
"stamping the clock."
msgstr ""
"对确定性后端而言，同一文档渲染两次会产出字节完全一致的结果。这正是报表可以安全哈希与比较的原因，也是工作簿写出器固定 ZIP "
"时间戳而不是打上当前时间的原因。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:35
msgid "Artifact bundles"
msgstr "Artifact bundle"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:37
msgid "The plotting and PDF renderers return a `report_artifact_bundle`:"
msgstr "绘图与 PDF 渲染器返回 `report_artifact_bundle`："

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:39
msgid ""
"`metadata` always carries `backend` and `report_digest`; `report_digest()` "
"is the document's semantic digest, so two backends of one document agree."
msgstr ""
"`metadata` 始终携带 `backend` 与 `report_digest`；`report_digest()` "
"是文档的语义摘要，因此同一文档的不同后端彼此一致。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:41
msgid ""
"`artifacts` carries named outputs (`figure`, `file`, "
"`axis:<section>.<series>`) with `name`, `path`, `owned` and `content`."
msgstr ""
"`artifacts` 携带具名输出（`figure`、`file`、`axis:<section>.<series>`），并带 "
"`name`、`path`、`owned` 与 `content`。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:43
msgid ""
"`find(name)` returns `nullptr` when the name is absent, so an unchecked "
"dereference is a programming error rather than a silent default."
msgstr "`find(name)` 在名称不存在时返回 `nullptr`，因此不加检查的解引用是编程错误而不是静默默认值。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:45
msgid ""
"A caller-supplied axis, and the file produced by `write_pdf`, are **not "
"owned**: the caller keeps the lifetime."
msgstr "调用方提供的坐标轴，以及 `write_pdf` 产出的文件，都是**非拥有**的：生命周期由调用方负责。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:48
msgid "Escaping and non-finite values"
msgstr "转义与非有限值"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:50
msgid ""
"Two escaping schemes coexist because two output channels do. Markup text "
"goes through HTML entities; the series payload embedded in a script element "
"is JSON-escaped, so `<`, `>` and `&` become `\\u003c`, `\\u003e` and "
"`\\u0026` and no non-ASCII code point reaches the script source unescaped."
msgstr ""
"两套转义共存，因为有两个输出通道。标记文本走 HTML 实体；嵌入脚本元素的序列载荷走 JSON 转义，因此 `<`、`>`、`&` 变成 "
"`<`、`>`、`&`，且没有非 ASCII 码点以未转义形式进入脚本源。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:55
msgid ""
"Non-finite numbers are not printed as `NaN` text. Where a channel can carry "
"a gap the value becomes a null; where the geometry cannot, the point is "
"dropped or collapsed to zero. The renderer documents which one it does, "
"because a chart that silently plots zero for infinity is worse than one that"
" leaves a gap."
msgstr ""
"非有限数值不会打印成 `NaN` 文本。通道能承载空隙时该值变成 null；几何无法承载时该点被丢弃或折叠为 "
"0。渲染器会说明自己用哪一种，因为把无穷静默画成 0 比留出空隙更糟。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:60
msgid "Runtime catalog"
msgstr "运行时目录"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:62
msgid ""
"Operations are described rather than discovered by name at run time. Each "
"module exposes its own descriptor list — `metrics_operations()`, "
"`risk_operations()`, `portfolio_operations()`, and so on — and "
"`all_operations()` concatenates them in a fixed order. The order is part of "
"the digest, so it is not alphabetical and not incidental."
msgstr ""
"操作是被描述的，而不是运行时按名字发现的。每个模块暴露自己的描述符列表 —— "
"`metrics_operations()`、`risk_operations()`、`portfolio_operations()` 等 —— "
"`all_operations()` 按固定顺序拼接它们。该顺序是摘要的一部分，因此既不是字母序也不是偶然得到的。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:68
msgid ""
"`operation_catalog` registers specs and resolves requests; an unknown or "
"ambiguous name raises `operation_resolution_error`. A request produces an "
"`execution_plan`, and executing it yields a `runtime_result` whose payload "
"is a typed `runtime_value` rather than a stringly-typed map."
msgstr ""
"`operation_catalog` 注册规格并解析请求；未知或歧义的名字会抛 `operation_resolution_error`。请求产生 "
"`execution_plan`，执行后得到 `runtime_result`，其载荷是带类型的 `runtime_value` 而不是字符串映射。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:73
msgid "Sessions and caching"
msgstr "会话与缓存"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:75
msgid ""
"`analysis_context` caches deterministic computations. `summary()` returns "
"the same map on a second call and `computation_count(key)` stays at one — "
"the count, not the equality, is what proves the cache was used. Because the "
"cache is mutable, one context is single-threaded by construction; frames can"
" still be shared."
msgstr ""
"`analysis_context` 缓存确定性计算。`summary()` 在第二次调用时返回同一个映射，而 "
"`computation_count(key)` 保持为 1 —— "
"证明缓存被使用的是计数，而不是相等性。由于缓存可变，一个上下文在构造上是单线程的；帧仍然可以共享。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:80
msgid ""
"`analysis_session` owns its inputs and outputs and rejects calls after "
"`close()`. Closing twice is safe. An extension merge happens once even when "
"every callable is complete, so a session never half-applies a registration "
"set."
msgstr ""
"`analysis_session` 拥有自己的输入与输出，并在 `close()` "
"之后拒绝调用。重复关闭是安全的。即使每个可调用对象都完整，扩展合并也只发生一次，因此会话不会半途应用一组注册。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:84
msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:86
msgid ""
"Extension discovery uses the native snapshot and hook ABI documented in the "
"extension headers. Two properties matter when reading a snapshot:"
msgstr "扩展发现使用扩展头文件里写明的原生快照与 hook ABI。读快照时有两件事重要："

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:89
msgid ""
"Hooks carry an event name and a priority: lower priorities run first, and "
"hooks that share both an event and a priority are ordered by fingerprint. "
"Sorting the whole registry by priority alone would therefore reorder hooks "
"within an event."
msgstr ""
"hook 携带事件名与优先级：优先级更低者先运行，事件与优先级都相同的 hook 按 fingerprint "
"排序。因此仅按优先级排序整个注册表会打乱同一事件内的顺序。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:92
msgid ""
"The snapshot digest covers the ASCII-escaped payload, not host-encoded text,"
" so a non-ASCII identifier has one canonical byte form."
msgstr "快照摘要覆盖的是 ASCII 转义后的载荷，而不是宿主编码文本，因此非 ASCII 标识符只有一种规范字节形式。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:95
msgid ""
"Plotting adapters (ImPlot, GLFW-backed demos) are not part of the core CMake"
" consumer contract; they are built only when their options are enabled."
msgstr "绘图适配器（ImPlot、基于 GLFW 的示例）不属于核心 CMake 消费契约；只有启用相应选项时才会构建。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:98
msgid "A minimal report"
msgstr "最小报表"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"#include <fincore/report/html.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/models.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/xlsx.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_document document;\n"
"document.domain = \"demo\";\n"
"document.title = \"Demo\";\n"
"fincore::report_section section;\n"
"section.key = \"summary\";\n"
"fincore::report_metric metric;\n"
"metric.key = \"sharpe\";\n"
"metric.label = \"Sharpe\";\n"
"metric.number = 1.25;\n"
"section.metrics.push_back(metric);\n"
"document.sections.push_back(section);\n"
"\n"
"const std::string html = fincore::render_html(document, {.language = "
"\"en\"});\n"
"const std::string workbook = fincore::render_xlsx(document);\n"
msgstr ""
"#include <fincore/report/html.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/models.hpp>\n"
"#include <fincore/report/xlsx.hpp>\n"
"\n"
"fincore::report_document document;\n"
"document.domain = \"demo\";\n"
"document.title = \"Demo\";\n"
"fincore::report_section section;\n"
"section.key = \"summary\";\n"
"fincore::report_metric metric;\n"
"metric.key = \"sharpe\";\n"
"metric.label = \"Sharpe\";\n"
"metric.number = 1.25;\n"
"section.metrics.push_back(metric);\n"
"document.sections.push_back(section);\n"
"\n"
"const std::string html = fincore::render_html(document, {.language = "
"\"en\"});\n"
"const std::string workbook = fincore::render_xlsx(document);\n"

